flowchart LR
    %% where a browser request goes
    browser[Browser: Fluid] -->|static files| web[nginx or vite preview]
    browser -->|"/api"| web
    web -->|proxy| daemon[Daemon]
    daemon --> rest[rest crate: JSON API]
    daemon --> socket[Co-editing socket]
    rest --> engine[Engine]
    socket --> rooms[CollabSessions]
    rooms --> engine
    engine --> disk[(Domains on disk)]

    linkStyle default stroke:#666
    linkStyle 4 stroke:#7b1fa2,stroke-width:2px
